   "answer": "Depending on which framework you are using:\n\n* **AI RMF:** Assuming a governance structure is already in place, most users of the AI RMF would start with the GOVERN function, followed by the MAP function, and then continue to MEASURE or MANAGE [1]. Ideally, risk management efforts for AI systems start with the \"Plan and Design function in the application context\" [4][5].\n* **CSF:** The sources do not state which specific function to start with, though they mention that an organization will categorize assets under IDENTIFY and take steps to secure those assets under PROTECT [8], and that GOVERN informs how an organization implements the other five functions [8].",
